Third-party data in the test fixtures
-------------------------------------

Some files under the testdata directories are verbatim copies or excerpts of
files published by CONAGUA / Servicio Meteorológico Nacional (Comisión
Nacional del Agua); the others are synthetic files written in the same
format. The CONAGUA files are:

  internal/conagua/testdata/cat_ags.html
  internal/conagua/testdata/daily/real_01001.txt
  internal/conagua/testdata/header/real_daily_01001.txt
  internal/conagua/testdata/header/real_daily_25171_wrapped.txt
  internal/conagua/testdata/normals/real_1991_2020_01001.txt
  internal/ingest/testdata/normals_1981_2010_01001.txt
  internal/cmd/testdata/ (catalogo/, Diarios/, Normales9120/)

They remain under CONAGUA's terms, not under this repository's license:

  Dataset:            Normales Climatológicas por Estado — per-station
                      climatological normals and daily observation files
  Source:             CONAGUA / Servicio Meteorológico Nacional
  Source URL:         https://smn.conagua.gob.mx/tools/RESOURCES/Normales_Climatologicas/
  Consultation dates: 2026-04-21 to 2026-08-30
  Terms:              Términos de Libre Uso MX (https://datos.gob.mx/libreusomx)

They are included only to test the parsers against the source's real format.
Their use here does not represent an official position of the Government of
Mexico, nor is it endorsed by CONAGUA or the Servicio Meteorológico Nacional.

The dataset this program builds is licensed separately: its own LICENSE
(CC BY 4.0, on the compilation) and NOTICE (the CONAGUA / SMN and NASA POWER
credits) ship inside every deposit.
